---
import { proofSteps, fullProofPlaceholder } from '../data/proof';
---
<section class="proof panel" id="demonstration" data-proof aria-labelledby="proof-title">
  <div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Démonstration</p><h2 id="proof-title">Chaque étape, à votre rythme.</h2></div><a href="#preuve-integrale" class="text-link">Preuve intégrale <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <p class="muted">Interface de progression provisoire. Aucune étape ci-dessous ne contient de démonstration validée.</p>
  <div class="proof-layout"><div class="proof-progress"><p class="eyebrow" data-proof-progress role="status">Emplacement 1 sur {proofSteps.length}</p><div class="proof-steps">{proofSteps.map((step, index) => <details open={index === 0} data-step><summary><span class="step-number">0{index + 1}</span>{step.title}<span class="step-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div><p>{step.placeholder}</p></div></details>)}</div><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-next-step disabled>Afficher l’emplacement suivant <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><aside class="full-proof" id="preuve-integrale" tabindex="-1"><span class="eyebrow">Accessible en permanence</span><h3>Preuve intégrale</h3><span class="badge">En attente de validation</span><p>{fullProofPlaceholder}</p></aside></div>
  <noscript><p>Ouvrez chaque emplacement à l’aide de son titre. La preuve intégrale reste accessible ci-dessus.</p></noscript>
</section>
<script>
  import { initProof } from '../scripts/proof';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-proof]').forEach(initProof);
</script>
